{"4882710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Feathered Fortune", "steam_appid": 4882710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4972110], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a medieval pigeon post, raise your flock, grow your business, and help the war-torn Kingdom of Melthoria recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/4da0fbf5a6ba03089f9936482d2c412f.poster.avif?t=1788167755\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/4da0fbf5a6ba03089f9936482d2c412f.webm?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/4da0fbf5a6ba03089f9936482d2c412f.mp4?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RUN YOUR OWN PIGEON POST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept delivery jobs, inspect each package, negotiate your payment, and build relationships with the people of Melthoria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/395a3f17f3506ff2548ada0b9e79342f.poster.avif?t=1788167755\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/395a3f17f3506ff2548ada0b9e79342f.webm?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/395a3f17f3506ff2548ada0b9e79342f.mp4?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PREPARE YOUR PIGEONS FOR THE JOURNEY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right pigeon by weighing its health and fatigue against each route’s distance, risks, rewards, and plague danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/d535711aeece2a74635e564fc50f5d96.poster.avif?t=1788167755\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/d535711aeece2a74635e564fc50f5d96.webm?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/d535711aeece2a74635e564fc50f5d96.mp4?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GROW YOUR FARM AND BUSINESS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, gather resources, trade your goods, and use your earnings to expand your home, postal facilities, and pigeon coops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/c0917fe5ebfc65a67719dd9e3f46bb59.poster.avif?t=1788167755\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/c0917fe5ebfc65a67719dd9e3f46bb59.webm?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/c0917fe5ebfc65a67719dd9e3f46bb59.mp4?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVERY DELIVERY CHANGES MELTHORIA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deliveries can restart production, change prices and merchant inventories, influence NPCs, and shape Melthoria’s recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/029e37ccd0da19ab44bce95ad6bf8310.poster.avif?t=1788167755\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/029e37ccd0da19ab44bce95ad6bf8310.webm?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/029e37ccd0da19ab44bce95ad6bf8310.mp4?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Run and expand a medieval pigeon post</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Negotiate delivery contracts with different customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hatch, raise, feed, and care for your pigeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Evaluate route risks, rewards, and plague danger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deliver letters, documents, decrees, and medicine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Grow crops, process resources, and trade goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Build and upgrade structures and pigeon coops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Change Melthoria through your deliveries</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a medieval pigeon post, raise your flock, grow your business, and help the war-torn Kingdom of Melthoria recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/4da0fbf5a6ba03089f9936482d2c412f.poster.avif?t=1788167755\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4882710/extras/4da0fbf5a6ba03089f9936482d2c412f.webm?t=1788167755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/